Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:08.82,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1200,6660,7540)\pos(640,425.962)}Episode 72\N\N\N\N\NSima Yi Takes Command
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:46.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,4580,4860)\pos(332,484.333)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:39.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,6580,6940)\pos(332,500.333)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I am quite old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can no longer see the restoration of the central plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not able to fulfill the last wishes of the former emperor to the best of my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The great task of restoring the Han dynasty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,is all up to you now, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot rest in peace, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"This matter is difficult to ascertain."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"When the former emperor was defeated at Chu,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"Cao Cao clapped his hands in response"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"and claimed the world was stabilized."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}"However, the former emperor went east to ally with Wu,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:03:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}"went west to seize the Bashu region, and invaded the North."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}"Xiahou Yuan lost his head\N and Cao Cao miscalculated."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"We were about to complete our mission,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"but then Wu betrayed the alliance, Guan Yu was defeated,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"we lost at Zigui, and Cao Pi declared himself emperor."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"All matters are like that, difficult to foresee."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"I will work extremely hard, only stopping when I die."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"As for victory and defeat,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,678)}"they are not matters I am able to foresee."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! The petition of the Chancellor is very moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.72,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Provide him with a force 300,000 strong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,to launch an expedition against Cao Wei on an auspicious day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,3260,3620)\pos(979.429,477.714)}Chéncāng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.48,0:03:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,North to Chencang was Jieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If Chencang was conquered, the Shu army could advance further north in Cao Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:47.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,3100,3500)\pos(972.571,502.857)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat the drums! Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:14.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(369.143,473.143}Hǎo Zhāo\NStyled: Bódào
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose arrows, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue beating the drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Put up the ladders!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose arrows, loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, loose arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the stones!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.01,0:05:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we climb up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.47,0:06:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose, loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat the drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Put up the ladders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:39.29,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Fill the oil! Fill the oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not expect Chencang to be this hard to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They have held off our army for half a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, the defending general, Hao Zhao, is proficient in military tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We used battering rams and dug \Nunderground tunnels, but they all failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here with a great army, yet I am being held off by that petty city?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we will launch an all-out attack. If we fail, military law will be enacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the Wei reinforcements have come!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is their leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Commander Cao Zhen, leading 150,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Their vanguard is Wang Shuang.\NThey are nearing Chencang!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to meet the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:05.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1920,2220)\pos(315.429,507.429)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you still are not sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Being unable to triumph over our foe, how can I rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come come come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You entered my tent this late at night, Boyue.\N There must be something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Chencang has tight defenses \Nand Hao Zhao is a resolute defender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that he also has aid from Wang Shuang,\Nit is truly difficult to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,In my opinion, we should have one major general defend this place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and have talented generals guard strategic roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you would lead the army to attack Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of such a plan before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It is just that with Cao Zhen and his army coming, if we only defend and not attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,our army would be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei army would wait for that, \Nthen battle us when we are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I did not adopt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan that will lure Cao Zhen to Xie valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"Many respects from the enemy general, Jiang Wei."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"A letter to the Grand Commander Cao Zhen."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan is marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan is marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:31.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,3860,4180)\pos(310.667,493.333)}Cáo Zhēn\NStyled: Zǐdān
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei has just sent us a letter of surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He wishes to work for us to repent for his crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and he has invited us to enter Xie valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When we are going to battle, a fire will be lit as a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He will then surprise attack the Shu army from behind as we charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With an attack on all sides, \NZhuge Liang can be captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Commander, Zhuge Liang is a strategic man and Jiang Wei is very intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:54.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,4260,4500)\pos(330.286,396.571)}Fèi Yào
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I fear this is one of their tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei was originally a general for Wei,\Nbut he had no choice but to join Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now with his surrender, he has shown his loyal heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if this is true, do not march out yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me lead the army to\N Xie Valley to receive Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If I defeat the Shu army,\N I will credit all the glory to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is any evil plot, hold me responsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then. You may take my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:46.81,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,580)}Xie Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We spotted the Shu army at Xie valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders! If we meet the \NShu army, skirmish before retreating!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see a fire at their rear, then \Nturn around and fight! I will reinforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang, you led your army\N to the border, and lost every battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, you still have enough dignity to show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am vanguard commander Fei Yao, and I have come to capture you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bold words from a nameless rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get Cao Zhen to face me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Cao is like a pillar holding up Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he deign to do so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:04.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,2980,3380)\pos(292.571,452.571)}Guān Xìng\NStyled: Xīngguó
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,General, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back and kill them! We will capture Zhuge Liang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We fell for a trap! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.77,0:15:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You dishonorable traitor, you tricked us into this situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I intended to capture Cao Zhen, \Nbut it looks like you have come to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you surrender now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear minister, what good plan do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The key routes of Chencang already has\N Hao Zhao and Wang Shuang defending it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:50.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,3560,3940)\pos(972.571,489.143)}Sīmǎ Yì\NStyled: Zhòngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army does not dare\N move grain from that route.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:57.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,4740,5100)\pos(312,489.143)}Cáo Ruì\NStyled: Yuánzhòng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There is another road, a small and inconvenient one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:16:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My guess is that the rations Zhuge Liang\N and his army have will run out this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You should issue an imperial edict,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,ordering Cao Zhen to defend the mountain passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Without us fighting, the Shu army will run out of rations in just one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They will retreat, unable to fight, and \Nwe can then exploit their weakness to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang then can be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your idea is very correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall issue an edict ordering Cao Zhen to defend and to not engage in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, when you issue your edict, you must not say the view came from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,State that it is your divine will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.05,0:16:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am overstepping my duties, \NI fear the Commander would resent me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The Son of Heaven issued an edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our army has been ordered to defend, not engage in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We are to wait until the Shu army runs out \Nof supplies, as Zhuge Liang will then retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Boji, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the divine will of the Son of Heaven, but the view of Sima Zhongda.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What view?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that he is familiar with the military tactics Zhuge Liang uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Zhongda is thousands of {\i1}li{\i0} away from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,yet he was able to calculate the situation Zhuge Liang is facing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He must certainly be the person who will resist Shu invasions in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:38.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,4420,4780)\pos(289.143,492.571)}Guō Huái\NStyled: Bójì
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is arrogant about his talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks he can place me\N under his bidding from many {\i1}li{\i0} away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And to use the Son of Heaven as a way to convey his wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,he really is coercing people!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, he was just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you do not let it loom over your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, Sima Zhongda \Nis not to be mentioned in my tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is no ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When he sees that his rations are depleting, he will come up with a way to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we sit and wait for death?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan that will defeat the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My army has challenged them many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Wei army sticks to its firm defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have foresaw the depletion of our rations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All the major routes are guarded by strong Wei forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Transporting grain is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have checked our rations,\N they will not last over a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, do any of you have a good plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:19:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we can only fight to the \Ndeath for Chencang to open the routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, can you lure the Wei army out into the open again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.99,0:19:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Zhen is traumatized from my previous tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.43,0:19:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the grain supplies for Wei are going through Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.46,0:19:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Elaborate your report!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei army in Longxi has moved thousands of carts of grain and is camped at Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The grain escort is Sun Li, who only has 3,000 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:34.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(957.714,469.714)}Liào Huà\NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, this is a chance gifted by Heaven! Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousands of carts of grain defended by only 3,000 men. We can win the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:38.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(341.714,509.714)}Wáng Píng\NStyled: Zǐjūn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we want to go! Chancellor, we want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General, ahead of us is the Wei camp with the grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:54.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(982,477.714)}Mǎ Dài
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.84,0:20:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.09,0:20:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the Shu army has come to rob our grain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:10.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(885.714,480)}Sūn Lǐ\NStyled: Dédá
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to them, go inform the Commander now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General, we were fooled. These are straw men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look into the carts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,General, they're full of dead grass. We've fallen into a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.20,0:20:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Set a fire at the south camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army fell for our trap! Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.81,0:20:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Dai, why are you not surrendering now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:21:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell for our trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trap is petty. How could you have hid it from our Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it is you who fell for a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fallen for our trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not surrender now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They indeed fell for our trap to rob the grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.49,0:21:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We will follow your orders to rob the Shu camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an empty camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.69,0:21:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good, we fell for their trick! \NReturn to the camp, return now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat to the camp, retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates, open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We, Guan Xing and Zhang Bao, have been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.93,0:22:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat, retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.06,0:22:44.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,4900,5220)\pos(995.857,501.714)}Yáng Yí\NStyled: Wēigōng
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.30,0:22:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, how could you have devised such a genius plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Zhen suspected we had no rations, so he used the grain carts as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He lured me to rob him so that \Nhe could sneak attack my camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:23:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know what the enemy is thinking and \Nuse their tactics, it will not be difficult to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.05,0:23:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you know yourself and \Nyou know your enemy. You really are a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.95,0:23:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders. Prepare to withdraw our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.37,0:23:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, our army had a\N major victory over Wei. Why withdraw?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.81,0:23:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Our army had no supplies, so they fought desperately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.07,0:23:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they were newly defeated, they do not dare fight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.65,0:23:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Only by taking the opportunity to escape now\N when they least expect it can we safeguard matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.15,0:23:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Wei army cuts off our rear,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.10,0:23:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,if we are unable to retreat and are \Nforced into fighting without rations,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.77,0:23:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,how can we not be trapped here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.05,0:23:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If Wang Shuang of Chencang comes to pursue us, how can we resist?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.75,0:23:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I already sent someone to Wei Yan to \Ntell my plan for dealing with Wang Shuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you act all so smart and high, but you messed this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.62,0:24:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now several of our soldiers died and we lost our camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.53,0:24:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I see the court emissary?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.84,0:24:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, the General of the Left, Zhang He, is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.39,0:24:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.18,0:24:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.41,0:24:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.74,0:24:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I, following the divine will, have come to hear news.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.29,0:24:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You came from afar to help us you \Nmust have underwent many troubles. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.33,0:24:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.52,0:24:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang really is a scheming bastard. My army...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.12,0:24:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I already heard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.85,0:25:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,General, what important matters are there in court?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.78,0:25:09.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,2180,2500)\pos(298.286,472)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I left, I encountered Sima Zhongda.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.16,0:25:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, "If our army wins, \Nthe Shu army will not withdraw."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.78,0:25:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"If our army loses, the Shu army will withdraw."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.21,0:25:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that our army lost, I wonder if you have \Nfound out about the movements of the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.74,0:25:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Zhongda makes up these crazy guesses, speaking wildly without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he win a decisive battle thousands of {\i1}li{\i0} away?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.88,0:25:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Two days ago, Zhongda advised you to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.92,0:25:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You did not listen, and fell into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no harm in sending a person ahead to verify my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.21,0:26:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu Xun intends to invade us. \NWe need you to oppose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.14,0:26:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, in my humble opinion, Eastern Wu will not invade.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lu Xun has assembled forces in Jing province and Xiangyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.32,0:26:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He keeps on saying he will invade us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.22,0:26:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you, dear sir, say that he will not invade?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.30,0:26:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Zhuge Liang allied with Wu not because he did not want to annex it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.42,0:26:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but because he feared we would exploit their division to attack Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.07,0:26:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, he made a temporary alliance with Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.59,0:26:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu Xun of Wu also thinks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.33,0:26:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,His statements of invasion are\N nothing more than a series of bluffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He is waiting to see who wins and loses in order to take advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.70,0:26:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, do not defend against Lu Xun of Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.24,0:26:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend against Zhuge Kongming of Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.32,0:26:53.84,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Grand Commander Cao Zhen of Wei heard that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.84,0:26:58.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Wang Shuang, succeeding head general of Chencang, lost his head to Wei Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.42,0:27:02.57,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He felt emotionally hurt and was in a state of distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.57,0:27:05.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He thus returned to Luoyang to recuperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.21,0:27:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Report, Your Majesty. The defending general of Chencang, Wang Shuang, lost his head to Wei Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.73,0:27:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Major general Guo Huai urgently reported this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.35,0:27:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has already seized Chencang.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.84,0:27:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He has led his army to Mount Qi again, invading us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.04,0:27:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,As I expected, Kongming has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, Commander Cao Zhen is here recuperating from illness, bedridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.58,0:27:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we drive back the foe?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.80,0:27:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall make you, dear sir, the Grand Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.53,0:27:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You will command the armies of Longxi to drive back Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.98,0:27:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I am talentless and stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.59,0:27:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not worthy of such a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.20,0:27:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send for the seal of Commander Cao Zhen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.98,0:27:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.50,0:27:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,While I am willing to aid the Grand Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.30,0:27:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not accept the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.49,0:28:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do not accept this responsibility, the Wei dynasty will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.14,0:28:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty has given me a gracious order. I dare not accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.21,0:28:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.18,0:28:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.09,0:28:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please allow me to go get the seal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.31,0:28:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, Commander Sima requests to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.53,0:28:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.53,0:28:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.27,0:29:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.92,0:29:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.87,0:29:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongda!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.20,0:29:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit, sit, sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.06,0:29:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the long sigh, Zhongda?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.05,0:29:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What you do not know is that
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.58,0:29:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wu and Shu have joined forces to invade us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.82,0:29:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is leading a force of 300,000 to Mount Qi
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.69,0:30:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and he has already seized Chencang.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.90,0:30:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He is now marching towards Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.37,0:30:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency! \NWhy did you not speak up earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.53,0:30:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is worried about your poor health.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.08,0:30:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He thus did not tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.83,0:30:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the situation is critical, he sent me to visit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.72,0:30:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,When will you be able to recover and lead troops into battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.05,0:30:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My illness is a severe one. \NI fear I will not recover fully.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.74,0:30:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this is a national emergency,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.03,0:30:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,why has the Emperor not made you the \NGrand Commander to repel the Shu army?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.26,0:30:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am talentless and stupid. It would be hard for me to assume the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.29,0:31:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, get the seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.08,0:31:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.14,0:31:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.65,0:31:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No no, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.04,0:31:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongda, if you decline the seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.53,0:31:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go petition the Emperor about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.16,0:31:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, to be honest, the Emperor already showed me such kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.73,0:31:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is just that I do not dare assume such a crucial task.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.86,0:31:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongda, why are you saying this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.07,0:31:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there another reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.44,0:31:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, everything I have said has come from my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.65,0:31:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably have reservations \Nabout this, so you have politely declined.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.71,0:32:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.50,0:32:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have never doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.05,0:32:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I did not heed your\N loyal advice, I suffered a major defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.01,0:32:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the Heavens can show how guilty I am feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.96,0:32:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.04,0:32:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongda, I hope you will consider the survival of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.16,0:32:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking the seal and repelling the foe would be a blessing to the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.58,0:32:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What you said is very touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.50,0:32:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to follow orders than to be respectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.42,0:32:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, I shall take the seal for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.38,0:32:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When you recover, I will return the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall not disappoint the vast \Nkindness of the Son of Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.03,0:32:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall drive back the Shu army!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.18,0:33:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has led his army \Nfrom thousands of {\i1}li{\i0} away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.69,0:33:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He would have fought quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.78,0:33:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, now that he is refraining his army from acting, he must have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.44,0:33:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Any news on the commanderies of Longxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.05,0:33:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The armies in them are vigilant, day and night. There is nothing more to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.98,0:33:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The only ones we have not yet heard back from are Wudu and Yinping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.58,0:33:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,These two are important border defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.61,0:33:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang must have already attacked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.24,0:33:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.12,0:34:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send troops to challenge\N the Shu camp to deceive Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.64,0:34:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You two will lead some troops and assault the \NShu army from behind in order to lift the sieges.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.10,0:34:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.91,0:34:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, otherwise you will be in danger if you go deep into enemy territory alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.14,0:34:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rest at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.58,0:34:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We will set off with troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How does Commander Sima compare to Zhuge Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.28,0:34:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I fear he is not as good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.26,0:34:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he is not as good,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.65,0:34:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,this plan is enough to show his inhuman wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.45,0:34:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army is attacking\N the two areas from the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.16,0:34:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we are striking him from behind,\N how could Zhuge Liang not be defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.41,0:34:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.45,0:34:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yinping and Wuping have been \Ncaptured by Wang Ping and Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.89,0:34:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not far ahead, there are more Shu troops moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.30,0:34:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the Shu army deploy troops outside the city after they had captured it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.85,0:35:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a trap. \NWe should retreat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.16,0:35:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders! Retreat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.30,0:35:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Guo Huai, Sun Li, do not escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.73,0:35:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I have not known about Sima Yi and his plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.58,0:35:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He had people challenge us \Nin front of our camp every day
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.01,0:35:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so that you would attack my rear \Nand relieve the sieges of Wudu and Yinping.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.66,0:35:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two commanderies are\N ours now, so why not surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.18,0:35:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only fight to the death now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.28,0:35:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, retreat, retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.92,0:36:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, dismount!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.70,0:36:04.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(385.143,342.857)}Zhāng Bāo
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.26,0:36:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not run!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.09,0:36:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guo!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.94,0:36:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, Wudu and Yinping commanderies have been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.53,0:36:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang had ambushes all over the roads
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.82,0:36:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and inflicted a lot of casualties, defeating us!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.88,0:36:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to abandon our horses to flee on foot, barely escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.06,0:36:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.33,0:36:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You two will not be blamed for this defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.76,0:36:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.36,0:36:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang plotted against my plot \Nand strategized against my strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.49,0:36:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He is more wise than me; I cannot reach his level.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.70,0:36:53.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1027.429,409.143)}Dài Líng
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.73,0:36:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang He.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.12,0:36:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.00,0:36:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Zhuge Liang captured Wudu and Yinping,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.17,0:37:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,he will certainly leave his camp to\N enter the city and calm the people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.82,0:37:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you and General Dai Ling will lead troops
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.72,0:37:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,to flank the rear of the Shu camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.98,0:37:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead an army in front of the camp
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.66,0:37:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and wait for them to fall into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.30,0:37:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will then lead my army to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.46,0:37:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As they are attacked on all sides, we will surely seize the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.72,0:37:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.45,0:37:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Move the grain carts quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.32,0:37:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He, Dai Ling, did you two follow what Sima Yi directed?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.93,0:37:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to raid my camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.58,0:37:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi never expected that I would welcome you two here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.32,0:37:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.85,0:38:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You are just nameless soldiers. I will not kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.54,0:38:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off your horses and surrender to the true lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.93,0:38:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Villager Zhuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.48,0:38:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You were lucky this time! Do not be so confident!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We are major generals for our nation! How could we surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.97,0:38:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.61,0:38:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Old traitor Zhang He, where are you going to flee?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.53,0:38:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.84,0:38:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.60,0:39:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.90,0:39:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.88,0:40:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.93,0:40:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now with what I am seeing, I have just realized how brave he is.
